---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for emergencyplumberlansing.us—how we handle information submitted through this website."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span> <span>Privacy Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="prose">
        <p><em>Last updated: November 2025</em></p>
        <p>
          This privacy policy describes how emergencyplumberlansing
          (“we,” “us”) handles information collected through the website
          emergencyplumberlansing.us.
        </p>
        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you use our contact form, we collect the information you provide—
          such as name, email address, phone number, location, and message content.
          We use this information solely to respond to your inquiry and provide
          requested services.
        </p>
        <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to service requests and questions</li>
          <li>To schedule appointments and follow up on work</li>
          <li>To improve our website and communications when relevant</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not sell your personal information. We do not use contact form
          data for unrelated marketing without your consent.
        </p>
        <h2>Form Processing</h2>
        <p>
          Contact form submissions are processed through Web3Forms or a similar
          third-party form service. That provider’s privacy practices apply to
          data in transit and storage on their systems. We encourage you to
          review their policies as well.
        </p>
        <h2>Cookies and Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          This site may use basic hosting or analytics tools that set cookies
          or collect anonymized usage data. You can control cookies through your
          browser settings.
        </p>
        <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our site may link to external websites. We are not responsible for the
          privacy practices of those sites.
        </p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy-related questions, contact us through the
          <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> or at the business address listed
          on this site.
        </p>
        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The “last updated” date
          at the top will reflect the most recent revision.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
